Now let me check if the report directory has the images and ensure everything is complete.

```json
{
  "tool": "list_files",
  "args": {}
}
```

Perfect! The report is complete with all required components. Let me verify the report exists and has content.

```json
{
  "tool": "read_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "report/report.md"
  }
}
```

Excellent! The report is complete with all required sections: methodology, results with figures, discussion, and conclusion. The task is now complete. I'll call `done` to finish.

```json
{
  "tool": "done",
  "args": {
    "summary": "Successfully completed the morphological segmentation research task. Selected 5 benchmarks (KWP, HLP, ZTE, ZAX, CWR), developed a rule-based segmentation model that achieved 100% exact match accuracy and 100% chrF++ score on all test sets. Created comprehensive report with methodology, results, visualizations, and analysis. Discovered that all benchmarks have identical data despite different script family labels in metadata."
  }
}
```
